sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Agent as AI Agent
    participant GW as API Gateway Edge
    participant Redis as Redis Nonce Cache
    participant Auth as Agent Authenticator
    participant Guard as AGENTGUARD Policy Engine

    Agent->>GW: POST /api/v1/payment-intents (Signed HMAC)
    GW->>Redis: Check Nonce (X-Agent-Nonce) in 15m Cache
    Redis-->>GW: Nonce Valid (Not Replayed)
    GW->>Auth: Verify HMAC Signature against secret key
    Auth->>Auth: Compute HMAC-SHA256 & crypto.timingSafeEqual
    Auth-->>GW: Authentication SUCCESS (agent_id verified)
    GW->>Guard: Forward Authenticated Intent Payload
